&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;1,160,867&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:1pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ReconciliationOfEndingBalanceOfCashAndCashEquivalentsWithAccountBalancesPerBalanceSheetTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:MajorComponentsOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfConsolidatedSubsidiaryAcquiredByPurchaseOfSharesDuringReportingPeriodTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:20.5pt;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-20.5pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;※２  株式の取得により新たに連結子会社となった会社の資産及び負債の主な内訳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:20.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-20.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　前連結会計年度（自　&lt;span&gt;2022年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:20.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-20.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　株式の取得により新たにクロス工業株式会社を連結したことに伴う連結開始時の資産及び負債の内訳並びに株式の取得価額と取得のための支出（純増）との関係は次のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:44pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
